    "updated_at": "2016-12-22T08:38:59Z",
    "body": "I think it doesn't make sense to use the block-start edge of the viewport and the bock-start edge of the dialog, because they could have orthogonal writing modes. You need to pick one or the other and use the same physical edge for both.\r\n\r\nNote:\r\n> The mapping depends on the parent element’s writing-mode and direction.\r\n\r\nhttps://drafts.csswg.org/css-logical-props/#propdef-offset-block-start",
